     2744     then do:
     2745       ASSIGN
     2746         sch-date :POPUP-MENU in frame Dialog-Frame = MENU m-ed-date22 :HANDLE
     2747         sch-date :MENU-MOUSE in frame Dialog-Frame = 3
     2748       .
