     2761         .
     2762       end.
     2763     end.
     2764     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date22-1 in menu m-ed-date22 DO:
     2765       apply "ctrl-b":U to sch-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     2766     END.
     2767     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date22-2 in menu m-ed-date22 DO:
