     2995           .
     2996       end.
     2997     end.
     2998     if l-filter-open-27 = false then do:
     2999       OPEN QUERY br-bonus FOR EACH X_chk-bonus
     3000         where            X_chk-bonus.obj-type  = p-obj-type            AND X_chk-bonus.obj-code  = p-obj-code                AND X_chk-bonus.chk-date  >= 01/01/1990                AND X_chk-bonus.chk-date  <= 12/31/9999                AND X_chk-bonus.record-type  = 4
